  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjbD2umaCi2Y-NRBABXs5TTHSJBwCz4Y1J5utDhyphenhyphenMjsMRDObLiVp4I4HuYG5VwOJoitEnaaF5jZjwnb7VIhTMAX0lNYgKlQ63VSJimfhzODZIk5oxOLVshDOAj2rf5jKVd5ORwK3rLPHBMZnHv7LcuAhonodn81yBnbmhqClPZ6pHM_ceHHRMcl8qB0eZ4/s1024/DALL%C2%B7E%202025-03-06%2017.15.11%20-%20A%20cartoon%20illustration%20of%20a%20mushroom%20patch%20with%20various%20mushrooms,%20each%20having%20a%20different%20vibrant%20color.%20The%20mushrooms%20have%20exaggerated%20shapes%20and%20pl.webp\"><img alt=\"חלקת פטריות צבעוניות - דימוי לקהילות שצצות כפטריות\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjbD2umaCi2Y-NRBABXs5TTHSJBwCz4Y1J5utDhyphenhyphenMjsMRDObLiVp4I4HuYG5VwOJoitEnaaF5jZjwnb7VIhTMAX0lNYgKlQ63VSJimfhzODZIk5oxOLVshDOAj2rf5jKVd5ORwK3rLPHBMZnHv7LcuAhonodn81yBnbmhqClPZ6pHM_ceHHRMcl8qB0eZ4/w320-h320/DALL%C2%B7E%202025-03-06%2017.15.11%20-%20A%20cartoon%20illustration%20of%20a%20mushroom%20patch%20with%20various%20mushrooms,%20each%20having%20a%20different%20vibrant%20color.%20The%20mushrooms%20have%20exaggerated%20shapes%20and%20pl.webp\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">כל קהילות הקודש</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַיַּקְהֵל מֹשֶׁה אֶת כָּל עֲדַת בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גִּוּוּן הוּא דָּבָר נָאֶה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַפִּצּוּל - קְצָת פָּחוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נוֹרָא בִּמְיֻחָד, אִם קוֹרֶה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּתוֹךְ אוֹתָן מִשְׁפָּחוֹת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קְהִלּוֹת וַחֲצֵרוֹת,<br />צָצוֹת כְּפִטְרִיּוֹת.<br />כֻּלָּן קְדוֹשׁוֹת,<br />וּמְלַכְּדוֹת שׁוּרוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֶשְׁנָם 'שׁוֹמְרֵי שַׁבָּת',<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְ'שׁוֹמְרֵי שַׁבָּת חֲסִידִים'.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְזוֹ הָאַחֲרוֹנָה, מְרֻבַּת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גּוֹמְלֵי חֲסָדִים חֲסוּדִים.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל גַּם הַלִּיטָאִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֹא טוֹמְנִים יָדָם בַּצַּלַּחַת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּפְלָגִים יְרוּשַׁלְמִיִּים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֵינָם יוֹשְׁבִים בְּנַחַת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל, בּוֹא נַגִּיד תַּ'אֶמֶת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">גַּם הַשְּׁכֵנִים הָלְכוּ רָחוֹק.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הֵם לֹא מַפְסִיקִים לְהִתְעַמֵּת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַדֶּשֶׁא שֶׁלָּהֶם - לֹא יָרֹק.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ שָׁם קְהִלָּה רֵפוֹרְמִית,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּקְהִלָּה תּוֹמֶכֶת-לוֹמֶדֶת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ גַּם קְהִלָּה אֵקוֹלוֹגִית,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְיֵשׁ אֶת פוֹרוּם-קֹהֶלֶת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קְהִלָּה אוֹטוֹנוֹמִית,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רוּסִית אוֹ אֶתְיוֹפִּית,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דָּתִית/דִּיגִיטָלִית,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שִׁתּוּפִית/פּוֹלְיָאמוֹרִית.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לִקְהִלּוֹת לְלֹא גְּלוּטֵן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ חֹסֶן קְהִלָּתִי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַקָּהָל שָׁם לֹא עוֹיֵן,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוּא פָּשׁוּט דַּעְתָּנִי.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַנְשֵׁי 'שׁוּבוֹ בָּנִים',<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חוֹבְבִים מוּזִיקַת טְרַנְס.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבְ'רְטוֹרְנוֹ' מְשַׁקְּמִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְכוּרֵי גְּרָאס מִפְרַאנְס.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קֻפּוֹת הַחוֹלִים מְחַפְּשׂוֹת,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְתָאֲמֵי קִשְׁרֵי קְהִלָּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דְּרוּשׁוֹת 'נְשָׁמוֹת טוֹבוֹת',<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עִם בְּלוֹטוּס' בָּאָזְנִיָּה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַנְשֵׁי קְהִלַּת הַמּוֹדִיעִין,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חוֹמְקִים לָהֶם בִּקְלִילוּת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְסִירִים מֵעַצְמָם בְּיוֹדְעִין,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּל טִפַּת אַחְרָיוּת.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָמְנָם,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הֵם</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שָׁלְחוּ לְנִיר עֹז,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶת קְהִלַּת צֶוֶת 'טָקִילָה' הַמְּיֻמָּן.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַךְ אֲבוֹי, נִכְבַּשׁ הַמָּעֹז,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֶׁהַשַּׂר עוֹדֶנּוּ מְנֻמְנָם.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לָכֵן, מִכָּאן תֵּצֵא קְרִיאָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְוַעֲדַת חֹק וְחֻקָּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְהַכְרִיז קְבַל עַם וְעֵדָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">'הַהִתְקַהֲלוּת הַזּוֹ אֲסוּרָה'.</span></span></p>"
